# Downloaded runtime models. NEVER committed (ADR-0016, PRD 17.2).
# The openWakeWord pretrained models are CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (non-commercial) and
# are fetched to the user's own machine by an explicit action, not bundled.
# Install:   python -m jarvis.main --install-wake-model
# Remove:    python -m jarvis.main --uninstall-wake-model
models/
*.onnx
*.tflite
